      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "By 1900 a general store existed, and by 1901 a post office opened two miles west of the original camp.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wauconda%2C_Washington",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The town declined in the early 1900s as mines closed, leaving it a ghost town today.",
